        "full_text_html": "<p><div class=\"tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text\" dir=\"auto\"><img alt=\"🇧🇾\" class=\"tg-custom-emoji\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F87A7F09F87BE.png\"/> «Сцяг пераможны - радасцi сцяг»</p>\n<p>Номинация: «Семейное фото с флагом»<br/><img alt=\"📷\" class=\"tg-custom-emoji\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F93B7.png\"/>На фото: ОАО \"Пинский мясокомбинат\"</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://vk.com/search/statuses?q=%23%D0%91%D0%A0%D0%A1%D0%9C\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#БРСМ</a> <a href=\"https://vk.com/search/statuses?q=%23%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B4%D1%84%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B3%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%83%D1%81%D0%B8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#подфлагомбеларуси</a> <a href=\"https://vk.com/search/statuses?q=%23%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#роднаенароднае</a> <a href=\"https://vk.com/search/statuses?q=%23%D0%9C%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%B6%D1%8C%D0%9F%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#МолодежьПинска</a></div></p>"
